# Audible browser/host parity with live Remix changes in all APPLY modes.
wav remix_parity.wav
wait 500
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
wait 8
tap SEQ
turn SELECT 1
turn K1 -1
turn K3 1
tap PLAY
wait 480
turn K4 1
wait 480
turn K1 1
turn K3 1 80
turn K3 1 80
turn K3 1 80
wait 800
turn K1 1
turn K2 1
turn K4 -1
wait 2080
turn K1 1
turn K3 1
turn K4 1
wait 2080
# Record a sweep into the active Remix, then listen after the gesture ends.
tap EDIT
tap REC
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
wait 240
turn K1 1
wait 240
turn K1 1
tap REC
wait 2080
# Disable Remix and hear the modified original source Motion.
tap SEQ
turn K4 -1
wait 2080
tap PLAY
turn K2 1
wait 480
wavstop
